From 30fa7aec82cb61651e0f9e8862a561da95c1d989 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: kernel86-64 <87580651+kernel86-64@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Tue, 24 Nov 2026 00:39:22 +0300
Subject: [PATCH 57/57] media: i2c: import donor joan camera sensors and enable
 in joan_defconfig

Port the donor IMX351, S5K3M3, HI553 camera sensors and BU24235 lens
controller drivers and enable them in joan_defconfig so all 3 cameras
and the rear flashlight (with strength control) are exposed to Android.
---
